              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan gumi ufitini jed'u, gaafa tisse isani tolchani, beese male isani fud'atani, akasuma beese male gadi isani d'iisani isani balchoomsani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa isani lafa Misiriti godaantani achi teetani kaani, isani fed'uma teesanini achi d'at'ani; ammo worri Ashuru, beese male, irreeni isani fud'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 2.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana, AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, wonti tahe kunini maani? Isani nama boojiani, beese male isani fud'atani. Worri isani mohatu hojja ch'ufa ufi guddise kiyyibe na tufata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takaa tana isani aka anini Waaqa hubattani, ammalle aka anini isaniini dubbad'ele barattani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
